     v-mm-arrbase AT ROW 11.23 COL 25 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL AUTO-RETURN 
     v-hh-disponible AT ROW 12.31 COL 18 COLON-ALIGNED AUTO-RETURN 
     v-mm-disponible AT ROW 12.31 COL 25 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL AUTO-RETURN 
     v-hh-cierre AT ROW 13.38 COL 18 COLON-ALIGNED AUTO-RETURN 
     v-mm-cierre AT ROW 13.38 COL 25 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL AUTO-RETURN 
     RECT-13 AT ROW 1 COL 1
    WITH 1 DOWN NO-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER OVERLAY 
         SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D 
         AT COL 1 ROW 1 SCROLLABLE .


